idic environment), and (3) **Vitamin B12 deficiency** (as gastric acid is required to cleave B12 from dietary protein). When de-prescribing PPIs, a **gradual taper** or switching to an as-needed H2 receptor antagonist is recommended to avoid **rebound gastric acid hypersecretion**.'),
